description	"Bralor

A cunning duelist who uses every advantage possible, many integrated weapons and excellent martial skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Kelborn's Vibroblade (Red/Purple Saber)
-- No Blaster Block
-- Saber Defense (2)

^8Attributes:
- 30% less Kb Taken
- Strength (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Beskar (3)
- Healing (2)
- Anti Mind Trick (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Environmental Protection (2)
- Flipkick (1)

^3Abilities:
- Mandalorian Combat Shield
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS3]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS2]
- Jetboots (Jetpack)
- Vambrace Microrockets ^3[CS4 Melee]
